OL,3,GNEWSAThunderbirds-inspired house sells
OL,4,Afor #375,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FA house with an "extensive" network of
OL,7,Ftunnel, rooms and a railway more than
OL,8,F15m underground has been sold at
OL,9,Fauction for #375,000.
OL,11,FThe property in Long Lane, Tilehurst,
OL,12,Fwas inspired by Tracy Island, the
OL,13,Fsecret headquarters featured in 1960s
OL,14,FTV series Thunderbirds.
OL,16,FBeginning more than two decades ago,
OL,17,Fthe tunnels were the passion-project of
OL,18,Fcivil engineer Tony Deane.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
